Needle 3 on ESP32-S3

The C engine, firmware scaffold, and host test utilities derive from:
  andrisgauracs/needle-2-esp32
  https://github.com/andrisgauracs/needle-2-esp32
  revision 61cafad7014a5664bb3ffd5f0c457ce5aa6598ae
  Licensed under Apache License 2.0 (included in LICENSE and engine/NOTICE-LICENSE).

This project modifies that code for the Needle 3 archive and architecture,
adds model selection, a two-pass local telemetry agent and HTTP bridge,
and supplies reproducible demos.

Needle 3 architecture and model weights are by Cactus Compute, Inc.:
  https://github.com/cactus-compute/needle
  https://huggingface.co/Cactus-Compute/needle3
  revision 9da75122d4ca11aa4a667281c9c8ba38a7eed679
  Licensed under Apache License 2.0 (model card: "license: apache-2.0").
Weights are downloaded separately and are not redistributed here. See
model/manifest.json for provenance.

  Needle: Automation Foundation Model for Tiny Devices. Ndubuaku, Henry;
  Mosoyan, Karen; Mroz, Jakub; Cylich, Noah; Kumar, Satyajit; Sandhu, Parkirat;
  Shemet, Roman; Lee, Justin H. Cactus Compute, Inc., 2026.
  https://github.com/cactus-compute/needle

